  <div class="latex-help-modal fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 hidden items-center justify-center z-50" id="latex-help-guide">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full mx-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-hidden">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">LaTeX Водич за почетници</h2>
        <button class="close-help-btn text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-300">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-y-auto p-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">⚡ LaTeX брз водич</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 p-3 rounded-lg">
              <div class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">\frac&#123;a&#125;&#123;b&#125;</div>
              <div class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Дропка</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 p-3 rounded-lg">
              <div class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">\sqrt&#123;x&#125;</div>
              <div class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Корен</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 p-3 rounded-lg">
              <div class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">x^&#123;2&#125;</div>
              <div class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Степен</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 p-3 rounded-lg">
               <div class="font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">\int f(x)dx</div>
              <div class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Интеграл</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 mb-3">📚 Основни правила</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200">
            <li>• Користете <code class="bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 px-1 rounded">\</code> за специјални симболи</li>
            <li>• За индекси користете <code class="bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 px-1 rounded">_</code>, за степени <code class="bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 px-1 rounded">^</code></li>
            <li>• За групирање користете <code class="bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 px-1 rounded">&#123; &#125;</code></li>
            <li>• Празни места се игнорираат - користете <code class="bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 px-1 rounded">\,</code> за мало растојание</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
